commit f82b69cb728fe82b39aa01d6ec5cc6165ffe3e3f
Author: donnie-j <31517975+donnie-j@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 1 17:40:33 2026 +0900

    ghdl.cc: drop USE_TWINEPOOL compatibility gate (#240)

    Plugin requires GhdlModule(Design*) which is 0.70-only; the pre-twine
    fallback paths are unreachable. Remove the version-guard macro and
    all three #ifdef USE_TWINEPOOL blocks. TO_STR stays, unconditional.

    Co-authored-by: Donald J Dionne <jeff@ibu-a.local>

